WEBVTT

00:02.480 --> 00:06.817
Water, earth,

00:06.901 --> 00:10.195
fire, air...

00:11.322 --> 00:15.367
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.451 --> 00:18.745
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.789 --> 00:23.709
Only the Avatar, master of all
four elements, could stop them.

00:23.793 --> 00:25.627
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.712 --> 00:27.004
he vanished.

00:27.422 --> 00:31.216
A hundred years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

00:31.301 --> 00:32.884
an airbender named Aang.

00:32.969 --> 00:35.262
And although his
airbending skills are great,

00:35.346 --> 00:38.015
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:38.975 --> 00:42.269
But I believe Aang can save the world.

01:14.927 --> 01:17.262
The only reason
you should be interrupting me

01:17.347 --> 01:20.057
is if you have news about the Avatar.

01:20.141 --> 01:22.267
Well, there is news, Prince Zuko,

01:22.352 --> 01:23.894
but you might not like it.

01:23.978 --> 01:25.020
Don't get too upset.

01:25.104 --> 01:27.898
Uncle, you taught me that
keeping a level head

01:27.982 --> 01:29.524
is a sign of a great leader.

01:29.609 --> 01:32.110
Now, whatever you have to say,
I'm sure I can take it.

01:32.653 --> 01:34.112
Ok, then.

01:34.197 --> 01:36.281
We have no idea where he is.

01:36.366 --> 01:37.574
What?

01:38.618 --> 01:41.036
You really should open a window
in here.

01:41.120 --> 01:42.287
Give me the map!

01:42.372 --> 01:45.791
There have been multiple sightings
of the Avatar,

01:45.875 --> 01:48.668
but he is impossible to track down.

01:48.753 --> 01:50.212
How am I going to find him, Uncle?

01:50.296 --> 01:53.340
He is clearly a master
of evasive maneuvering.

01:55.218 --> 01:57.552
You have no idea
where you're going, do you?

01:57.637 --> 01:59.429
Well, I know it's near water.

02:00.515 --> 02:02.516
I guess
we're getting close, then.

02:04.936 --> 02:06.645
Momo, marbles, please.

02:09.440 --> 02:12.234
Hey, Katara, check out
this airbending trick.

02:15.655 --> 02:16.947
That's great, Aang.

02:17.031 --> 02:19.574
You didn't even look.

02:19.659 --> 02:20.867
That's great.

02:20.952 --> 02:22.244
But I'm not doing it now.

02:22.328 --> 02:23.787
Stop bugging her, airhead.

02:23.871 --> 02:26.039
You need to give girls space
when they do their sewing.

02:26.165 --> 02:29.584
What does me being a girl
have to do with sewing?

02:29.669 --> 02:30.836
Simple.

02:30.920 --> 02:32.379
Girls are better
at fixing pants than guys,

02:32.463 --> 02:34.714
and guys are better at hunting
and fighting and stuff like that.

02:34.799 --> 02:36.425
It's just the natural order of things.

02:36.509 --> 02:37.717
All done with your pants,

02:37.802 --> 02:39.928
and look what a great job I did.

02:42.181 --> 02:43.765
Wait! I was just kidding!

02:43.850 --> 02:46.101
I can't wear these! Katara, please!

02:46.227 --> 02:47.436
Relax, Sokka.

02:47.520 --> 02:49.604
Where we're going,
you won't need any pants.

02:55.445 --> 02:57.279
We just made
a pit stop yesterday.

02:57.363 --> 02:59.531
Shouldn't we get a little more flying
done before we camp out?

03:00.241 --> 03:01.616
He's right. At this rate,

03:01.701 --> 03:03.535
we won't get to the North Pole
until spring.

03:03.619 --> 03:05.036
But Appa's tired already,

03:05.121 --> 03:06.580
aren't you, boy?

03:08.040 --> 03:10.625
I said, "Aren't you, boy?"

03:12.670 --> 03:15.005
Yeah, that was real convincing.

03:15.089 --> 03:17.924
Still, hard to argue
with a 10-ton magical monster.

03:18.342 --> 03:19.342
Look!

03:23.181 --> 03:25.765
That's why we're here... Elephant koi,

03:25.850 --> 03:27.142
and I'm going to ride it.

03:27.226 --> 03:28.977
Katara, you've got to watch me.

03:32.899 --> 03:34.524
Cold!

03:48.372 --> 03:49.498
Woo!

03:49.582 --> 03:51.500
Yeah!

03:55.838 --> 03:56.963
Woo-hoo!

03:59.050 --> 04:00.509
He looks pretty good out there.

04:00.593 --> 04:03.094
Are you kidding?
The fish is doing all the work.

04:03.888 --> 04:05.096
No, Appa!

04:05.181 --> 04:06.389
Don't eat that!

04:12.104 --> 04:13.522
Aw, man.

04:18.027 --> 04:19.277
There's something in the water!

04:24.283 --> 04:25.367
What's wrong?

04:25.451 --> 04:26.493
Aang's in trouble.

04:26.577 --> 04:28.286
-Aang!
-Get out of there!

04:29.497 --> 04:31.831
-Get back here, Aang!
-Come in!

04:39.757 --> 04:40.757
Aah!

04:54.897 --> 04:56.439
What was that thing?

04:56.524 --> 04:57.649
I don't know.

04:57.733 --> 04:59.401
Well, let's not stick around
to find out.

04:59.485 --> 05:00.944
Time to hit the road.

05:12.498 --> 05:14.624
Or we could stay a while.

05:19.297 --> 05:22.215
You three have some
explaining to do.

05:22.300 --> 05:24.426
And if you don't answer
all our questions,

05:24.510 --> 05:26.803
we're throwing you back
in the water with the unagi.

05:26.887 --> 05:28.847
Show yourselves, cowards!

05:31.767 --> 05:34.269
Who are you?
Where are the men who ambushed us?

05:34.353 --> 05:36.563
There were no men. We ambushed you.

05:36.647 --> 05:39.274
Now tell us, who are you
and what are you doing here?

05:39.358 --> 05:40.442
Wait a second.

05:40.526 --> 05:42.611
There's no way a bunch of girls
took us down.

05:42.695 --> 05:44.571
A bunch of girls?

05:44.655 --> 05:47.073
The unagi's going to eat well tonight.

05:47.158 --> 05:49.117
No, don't hurt him! He didn't mean it!

05:49.201 --> 05:51.328
My brother's just an idiot sometimes.

05:52.121 --> 05:53.788
It's my fault.

05:53.873 --> 05:55.040
I'm sorry we came here.

05:55.124 --> 05:56.583
I wanted to ride the elephant koi.

05:56.667 --> 06:00.086
How do we know
you're not Fire Nation spies?

06:00.171 --> 06:02.505
Kyoshi stayed out of the war so far

06:02.590 --> 06:04.633
and we intend to keep it that way.

06:04.717 --> 06:07.052
This island is named for Kyoshi?

06:07.136 --> 06:08.261
I know Kyoshi.

06:08.346 --> 06:09.512
Ha!

06:09.597 --> 06:11.264
How could you possibly know her?

06:11.349 --> 06:15.727
Avatar Kyoshi was born here
400 years ago.

06:15.811 --> 06:17.812
She's been dead for centuries.

06:19.315 --> 06:21.691
I know her because I'm the Avatar.

06:21.776 --> 06:23.068
That's impossible.

06:23.152 --> 06:26.571
The last Avatar was an airbender
who disappeared 100 years ago.

06:26.656 --> 06:27.656
That's me.

06:27.740 --> 06:29.991
Throw the impostor to the unagi.

06:33.412 --> 06:35.872
Aang, do some airbending.

06:38.668 --> 06:40.835
- Wow.
- That's amazing.

06:42.838 --> 06:44.130
It's true.

06:44.215 --> 06:46.174
You are the Avatar.

06:46.258 --> 06:48.510
Now, check this out.

06:57.478 --> 06:58.978
Did you hear the news?

06:59.063 --> 07:00.689
The Avatar's on Kyoshi.

07:10.533 --> 07:12.283
The Avatar's on Kyoshi island?

07:13.077 --> 07:14.869
Uncle, ready the rhinos.

07:14.954 --> 07:16.913
He's not getting away from me
this time.

07:16.997 --> 07:18.998
Are you going to finish that?

07:19.083 --> 07:21.000
I was going to save it for later!

07:39.854 --> 07:41.146
All right!

07:41.230 --> 07:42.522
Dessert for breakfast!

07:42.732 --> 07:46.317
These people sure know
how to treat an Avatar.

07:46.402 --> 07:48.445
Katara, you've got to try these.

07:48.529 --> 07:50.155
Well, maybe just a bite.

07:52.658 --> 07:54.284
Sokka, what's your problem?

07:54.368 --> 07:55.410
Eat!

07:55.494 --> 07:56.494
I'm not hungry.

07:56.704 --> 07:58.329
But you're always hungry.

07:58.414 --> 08:00.790
He's just upset
because a bunch of girls

08:00.875 --> 08:02.333
kicked his butt yesterday.

08:02.418 --> 08:03.585
They snuck up on me!

08:03.669 --> 08:05.879
Right, and then they kicked your butt.

08:06.297 --> 08:08.214
Sneak attacks don't count.

08:08.299 --> 08:09.883
Tie me up with ropes...

08:09.967 --> 08:12.010
I'll show them a thing or two.

08:12.094 --> 08:13.803
I'm not scared of any girls.

08:13.888 --> 08:15.930
Who do they think they are, anyway?

08:16.015 --> 08:17.891
This is tasty.

08:18.517 --> 08:20.477
What's he so angry about?

08:20.561 --> 08:21.603
It's great here.

08:21.687 --> 08:23.188
They're giving us the royal treatment.

08:23.397 --> 08:25.106
Hey, don't get too comfortable.

08:25.191 --> 08:27.776
It's risky for us to stay
in one place for very long.

08:27.860 --> 08:29.319
I'm sure we'll be fine.

08:29.403 --> 08:32.030
Besides, did you see how happy
I'm making this town?

08:32.114 --> 08:34.157
They're even cleaning up
that statue in my honor.

08:34.241 --> 08:37.660
Well, it's nice to see you excited
about being the Avatar.

08:37.745 --> 08:39.454
I just hope it doesn't
all go to your head.

08:39.663 --> 08:41.539
Come on, you know me better than that.

08:41.624 --> 08:43.416
I'm just a simple monk.

08:44.877 --> 08:46.753
There he is!

08:46.837 --> 08:48.963
There he is!!

09:09.401 --> 09:11.945
Painting the Avatar.

09:12.029 --> 09:13.613
That's easy enough.

09:13.697 --> 09:15.573
There's another one.

09:15.658 --> 09:17.700
Well, I'll make an adjustment
here and...

09:18.452 --> 09:19.786
There's more.

09:19.870 --> 09:21.162
I...

09:40.099 --> 09:43.309
Ooh! Heh heh!

09:44.979 --> 09:47.564
I can't believe I got beat up
by a bunch of girls.

09:51.652 --> 09:52.652
Sorry, ladies.

09:52.736 --> 09:54.696
Didn't mean to interrupt
your dance lesson.

09:54.780 --> 09:57.073
I was just looking for somewhere
to get a little workout.

09:57.157 --> 09:59.576
Well, you're in the right place.

09:59.994 --> 10:01.536
Sorry about yesterday.

10:01.620 --> 10:03.913
I didn't know
you were friends with the Avatar.

10:03.998 --> 10:05.039
It's all right.

10:05.124 --> 10:06.499
I mean, normally I'd hold a grudge,

10:06.584 --> 10:09.294
but seeing as you guys are a bunch
of girls, I'll make an exception.

10:09.378 --> 10:11.004
I should hope so.

10:11.088 --> 10:13.673
A big, strong man like you,

10:13.757 --> 10:15.216
we wouldn't stand a chance.

10:15.384 --> 10:16.885
True, but don't feel bad.

10:16.969 --> 10:19.095
After all, I'm the best warrior
in my village.

10:19.305 --> 10:21.556
Wow. Best warrior?

10:21.640 --> 10:23.057
In your whole village?

10:23.142 --> 10:26.019
Maybe you'd be kind enough
to give us a little demonstration.

10:27.146 --> 10:28.980
Well, I mean, I...

10:29.064 --> 10:30.356
Come on, girls,

10:30.441 --> 10:32.025
wouldn't you like him
to show us some moves?

10:33.694 --> 10:35.028
Well, if that's what you want,

10:35.112 --> 10:36.446
I'd be happy to.

10:36.530 --> 10:39.073
All right, you stand over there.

10:39.158 --> 10:41.701
Now, this may be a little tough,

10:41.785 --> 10:43.494
but try to block me.

10:46.790 --> 10:48.041
Good.

10:48.125 --> 10:49.626
Of course, I was going easy on you.

10:49.752 --> 10:50.752
Of course.

10:50.961 --> 10:52.587
Let's see if you can handle this!

10:52.671 --> 10:53.671
Ouch!

10:55.716 --> 10:56.758
That does it!

11:09.355 --> 11:11.272
Anything else you want to teach us?

11:16.862 --> 11:19.530
There she is, girls,
me in a past life.

11:22.034 --> 11:24.661
You were pretty.

11:24.745 --> 11:26.704
Excuse me for a second, ladies.

11:30.167 --> 11:31.209
Good.

11:31.293 --> 11:32.794
Can you help me carry this
back to the room?

11:32.878 --> 11:34.087
It's a little heavy.

11:34.171 --> 11:35.463
Actually, I can't right now.

11:35.547 --> 11:36.547
What do you mean, you can't?

11:36.632 --> 11:39.050
I promised the girls
I'd give them a ride on Appa.

11:39.134 --> 11:40.134
Why don't you come with us?

11:40.219 --> 11:41.219
It'll be fun.

11:41.345 --> 11:43.388
Watching you show off
for a bunch of girls

11:43.472 --> 11:44.597
does not sound like fun.

11:44.974 --> 11:47.392
Well, neither does
carrying your basket.

11:47.476 --> 11:48.977
It's not my basket.

11:49.061 --> 11:50.853
These supplies are for our trip.

11:50.938 --> 11:52.814
I told you,
we have to leave Kyoshi soon.

11:53.023 --> 11:54.857
I don't want to leave Kyoshi yet.

11:54.942 --> 11:56.484
I can't put my finger on it,

11:56.568 --> 11:58.903
but there's something
I really like about this place.

12:00.364 --> 12:03.616
What's taking you so long, Aangie?

12:03.701 --> 12:04.701
Aangie?

12:04.785 --> 12:06.244
Just a second, Koko.

12:06.328 --> 12:07.912
Simple monk?

12:07.997 --> 12:09.956
I thought you promised
me this Avatar stuff

12:10.040 --> 12:11.040
wouldn't go to your head.

12:11.208 --> 12:13.209
It didn't. You know what I think?

12:13.293 --> 12:15.753
You just don't want to come
because you're jealous.

12:15.838 --> 12:17.547
Jealous? Of what?

12:17.631 --> 12:19.882
Jealous that we're having
so much fun without you.

12:19.967 --> 12:21.175
That's ridiculous.

12:21.301 --> 12:22.593
It is a little ridiculous,

12:22.678 --> 12:23.678
but I understand.

12:36.025 --> 12:37.775
Hey, Suki.

12:38.652 --> 12:40.403
Hoping for another dance lesson?

12:40.487 --> 12:41.654
No, I...

12:41.739 --> 12:42.864
Well, let me explain.

12:42.948 --> 12:45.366
Spit it out. What do you want?

12:48.370 --> 12:50.913
I would be honored
if you would teach me.

12:50.998 --> 12:52.540
Even if I'm a girl?

12:52.624 --> 12:54.667
I'm sorry if I insulted you earlier.

12:54.752 --> 12:55.793
I was wrong.

12:55.878 --> 12:58.046
We normally don't teach outsiders,

12:58.130 --> 12:59.922
let alone boys.

13:00.007 --> 13:01.382
Please make an exception.

13:01.467 --> 13:02.508
I won't let you down.

13:02.634 --> 13:06.262
All right, but you have to follow
all of our traditions.

13:06.346 --> 13:07.388
Of course.

13:07.473 --> 13:09.640
And I mean all of them.

13:11.310 --> 13:12.643
Do I really have to wear this?

13:12.853 --> 13:14.812
It feels a little... Girly.

13:14.897 --> 13:16.522
It's a warrior's uniform.

13:16.607 --> 13:17.732
You should be proud.

13:17.816 --> 13:19.525
The silk thread symbolizes

13:19.610 --> 13:21.903
the brave blood
that flows through our veins.

13:21.987 --> 13:23.654
The gold insignia represents

13:23.739 --> 13:25.323
the honor of the warrior's heart.

13:27.034 --> 13:28.659
Bravery and honor.

13:28.744 --> 13:29.952
Hey, Sokka.

13:30.037 --> 13:31.162
Nice dress.

13:41.090 --> 13:45.176
Katara, remember how
the unagi almost got me yesterday?

13:45.260 --> 13:46.302
Yeah.

13:46.386 --> 13:48.221
Well, I'm going to go ride it now.

13:48.305 --> 13:49.931
It's going to be real dangerous.

13:50.015 --> 13:51.182
Good for you.

13:51.266 --> 13:52.308
You're not going to stop me?

13:52.392 --> 13:53.684
Nope. Have fun.

13:53.769 --> 13:55.019
I will. Great.

13:55.104 --> 13:56.145
I know it's great.

13:56.230 --> 13:57.271
Well, I'm glad you know.

13:57.356 --> 13:58.439
-I'm glad you're glad.
-Good!

13:58.524 --> 13:59.524
Fine!

14:06.865 --> 14:08.783
You're not going to master it
in one day.

14:08.867 --> 14:10.243
Even I'm not that good.

14:10.494 --> 14:11.994
I think I'm starting to get it.

14:21.630 --> 14:23.256
It's not about strength.

14:24.508 --> 14:27.510
Our technique is about using
your opponent's force against them.

14:27.594 --> 14:28.845
Loosen up.

14:28.929 --> 14:31.973
Think of the fan as an extension
of your arm.

14:32.057 --> 14:33.766
Wait for an opening and then...

14:39.022 --> 14:41.315
I fell on purpose
to make you feel better.

14:41.400 --> 14:42.400
I got you!

14:42.484 --> 14:43.484
Admit I got you!

14:45.362 --> 14:47.613
Ok, it was a lucky shot.

14:47.823 --> 14:49.782
Let's see if you can do it again.

14:56.582 --> 14:58.249
What's taking so long?

14:58.333 --> 15:00.710
I'm sure it will be here any second.

15:02.296 --> 15:05.006
Um, what about this?

15:05.090 --> 15:06.549
Not that again.

15:06.633 --> 15:07.717
Boring.

15:07.801 --> 15:09.218
Where's unagi?

15:09.428 --> 15:10.469
It's getting late.

15:10.721 --> 15:12.054
Where are you going?

15:12.139 --> 15:13.139
Don't leave!

15:13.515 --> 15:14.682
Sorry, Aang!

15:14.766 --> 15:15.933
Maybe next time!

15:21.064 --> 15:22.565
Katara, you showed up!

15:22.649 --> 15:24.942
I wanted to make sure you were safe.

15:25.027 --> 15:26.277
You really had me worried.

15:26.528 --> 15:28.446
Back there you acted like
you didn't care.

15:28.530 --> 15:30.031
I'm sorry.

15:30.115 --> 15:31.365
Me, too.

15:31.450 --> 15:33.618
I did let all that attention
go to my head.

15:33.702 --> 15:35.203
I was being a jerk.

15:35.287 --> 15:36.537
Well, get out of the water

15:36.622 --> 15:38.456
before you catch a cold, you big jerk!

15:39.625 --> 15:40.791
On my way!

16:27.756 --> 16:29.173
Hang on, Aang!

16:29.258 --> 16:30.424
Aah!

16:39.851 --> 16:40.851
Aang!

17:09.131 --> 17:10.131
Zuko!

17:24.563 --> 17:26.105
I want the Avatar alive.

17:42.539 --> 17:43.956
Wake up, Aang.

17:52.049 --> 17:53.049
Katara.

17:55.052 --> 17:56.927
Don't ride the unagi.

17:57.012 --> 17:58.429
Not fun.

18:05.145 --> 18:06.354
Not bad.

18:08.065 --> 18:10.066
Fire bandits have landed
on our shores.

18:10.150 --> 18:11.859
Girls, come quickly!

18:11.943 --> 18:13.736
Hey, I'm not a...

18:13.820 --> 18:15.488
Whatever.

18:21.870 --> 18:23.120
Come out, Avatar.

18:23.205 --> 18:24.622
You can't hide from me forever.

18:30.170 --> 18:31.379
Find him.

19:08.667 --> 19:10.376
I guess training's over.

19:22.556 --> 19:24.014
Nice try, Avatar,

19:24.099 --> 19:26.434
but these little girls can't save you.

19:26.852 --> 19:28.561
Hey, over here!

19:30.439 --> 19:31.564
Finally.

20:11.396 --> 20:12.688
Get inside.

20:16.776 --> 20:18.486
Look what I brought to this place.

20:18.570 --> 20:19.695
It's not your fault.

20:19.779 --> 20:21.071
Yes, it is.

20:21.156 --> 20:23.908
These people got their town destroyed
trying to protect me.

20:23.992 --> 20:25.284
Then let's get out of here.

20:25.368 --> 20:27.328
Zuko will leave Kyoshi to follow us.

20:27.412 --> 20:28.829
I know it feels wrong to run,

20:29.039 --> 20:30.247
but I think it's the only way.

20:31.500 --> 20:32.917
I'll call Appa.

20:39.591 --> 20:41.425
There's no time to say good-bye.

20:41.510 --> 20:42.801
What about "I'm sorry"?

20:42.886 --> 20:43.886
For what?

20:44.179 --> 20:45.179
I treated you like a girl

20:45.263 --> 20:47.056
when I should have
treated you like a warrior.

20:47.265 --> 20:48.682
I am a warrior...

20:50.644 --> 20:52.311
But I'm a girl, too.

20:54.397 --> 20:55.523
Now get out of here.

20:55.607 --> 20:56.941
We'll hold them off.

21:00.904 --> 21:02.404
Appa, yip yip!

21:05.158 --> 21:06.492
Back to the ship!

21:06.576 --> 21:08.202
Don't lose sight of them!

21:12.040 --> 21:14.416
I know it's hard,
but you did the right thing.

21:14.501 --> 21:17.211
Zuko would've destroyed
the whole place if we stayed.

